---
// A short aside: a clarification, a historical note, "you may have seen this written as".
// Keep it under about 60 words. A note, not a landmark: an unnamed <aside> would repeat Starlight's sidebar
// landmark in a screen reader's landmark list.
---

<div class="side-note" role="note"><slot /></div>

<style>
	.side-note {
		margin-block: 1rem 1.5rem;
		/* Indent, smaller muted serif: no hairline bar (decision 0006) */
		padding-inline-start: 1.5rem;
		max-inline-size: 52ch;
		font-family: var(--ms-font-serif);
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
		color: var(--ms-ink-muted);
	}

	.side-note :global(p) {
		margin: 0;
	}
</style>
